{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Turtle Race Timer 是一款把日常任務變成倒數賽跑的計時工具，適合學生溫習、上班族專注工作，以及閱讀、家務與運動等需要明確時間目標的情境。原價 US $0.99，現於 App Store 限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>動畫賽跑計時提升專注</h2>\n<p>Turtle Race Timer 把專注變成看得見的比賽。你可設定 1 秒至 24 小時的時長，開始後動畫烏龜隨時間向前移動，完成後點按 Done 即讓兔子衝向終點。程式內置草地、雪地與秋天場景，以及髮夾彎、流線與環狀路線，可開關音效並支援 14 種語言。最近用過的時長可快速重用，設定只留在裝置，無帳號、無廣告、無訂閱。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-427-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-428-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-429-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-430-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-431-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-432-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Turtle Race Timer</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T01:18:18.023259+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":336,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}